Aim: 4(b) Write a JAVA program to implement Multilevel Inheritance
Program:
class A {
  String str = " ";
  A() { str = "This"; }
}
class B extends A {
  B() { str = str.concat(" is"); }
}
class C extends B {
  C() { str = str.concat(" multilevel"); }
}
class D extends C {
